        --------

        Union matching dtypes

        >>> idx1 = pd.Index([1, 2, 3, 4])
        >>> idx2 = pd.Index([3, 4, 5, 6])
        >>> idx1.union(idx2)
        Int64Index([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], dtype='int64')

        Union mismatched dtypes

        >>> idx1 = pd.Index(['a', 'b', 'c', 'd'])
        >>> idx2 = pd.Index([1, 2, 3, 4])
        >>> idx1.union(idx2)
        Index(['a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 1, 2, 3, 4], dtype='object')
